# game/UpdateScript0.08_1.rpy:2621 #-#-# translate crowdin mom_investigates_eeb3f41b:
msgid "[_R_] I know you kicked her out of your room, but I think it's good for her to sleep with someone, just until she gets over these silly fears of hers."
