# game/UpdateScript0.08_1.rpy:7478 #-#-# translate crowdin prison_fashion_show_ee3d0b91:
msgid "[_R_] Yeah, It's subtle. You've got to really be paying attention to really notice. And I think it's a good idea for you to let Dad see a little bit of what he's missing."
