# game/UpdateScript0.08_1.rpy:7504 #-#-# translate crowdin prison_fashion_show_16f6566c:
msgid "[_MT_] {i}Fuck!... He's staring at my breasts! It seems like I should nip this kind of behavior in the bud, but if Will Tylor is right about Oedipus complexes, I need to let this run its course, or he might get stuck in this phase forever.{/i}"
